### New Endpoint (Optional)

```bash
GET /api/ai-gov-review/v1/reviews/{id}/context
```

Returns the knowledge base context that influenced the evaluation decision:

```json
{
  "review_id": "550e8400-...",
  "context_used": [
    {
      "source": "product_portfolio",
      "items": [
        {
          "product_name": "Claims Processing Suite v4.2",
          "relevance": 0.89,
          "influenced_findings": ["F001", "F003"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "ea_standards",
      "items": [
        {
          "adr_id": "ADR-042",
          "title": "Event-Driven Architecture Mandate",
          "relevance": 0.76,
          "influenced_findings": ["F002"]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
